{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Reusable Network Prompt Template.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Reusable Network Prompt Template.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"reusable network prompt template reusable network prompt template","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Reusable Network Prompt Template.md","fileName":"Reusable Network Prompt Template.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Reusable Network Prompt Template","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Network AI Application Architecture]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Reusable Network Prompt Template.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Reusable Network Prompt Template.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"reusable network prompt template reusable network prompt template","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Reusable Network Prompt Template.md","fileName":"Reusable Network Prompt Template.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Reusable Network Prompt Template","heading":"Reusable Network Prompt Template","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A reusable network prompt template defines stable instructions with explicit variables for configuration, device type, task, or audience. The same reviewed structure can then analyze multiple inputs without copying and gradually diverging prompt strings across an application.\n\nTemplate variables should be validated and clearly delimited so configuration text is not confused with instructions. Versioning the template makes behavioral changes inspectable. Reuse improves consistency, while task-specific templates prevent one oversized prompt from mixing security, optimization, and documentation requirements that need different evaluation criteria.","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd"